WEBVTT

00:00:04.648 --> 00:00:06.308
Wait. What?
Totaling her car?

00:00:07.168 --> 00:00:08.328
Leaving her tied
to a chair?

00:00:08.348 --> 00:00:09.428
I should rip you
limb from limb.

00:00:09.487 --> 00:00:10.980
[stammering]

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:11.817
[laughs]

00:00:11.817 --> 00:00:15.317
Oh, my God,
look at your face!

00:00:15.497 --> 00:00:17.617
Tommy, breathe, baby.
Breathe. I was kidding.

00:00:18.057 --> 00:00:20.297
Hey, man,
I was totally kidding.
Okay.

00:00:21.337 --> 00:00:22.458
You were kidding.
Yeah.

00:00:23.257 --> 00:00:24.857
I'm sorry.
Rachel put me up to it.

00:00:25.017 --> 00:00:26.037
It was totally her idea.

00:00:27.077 --> 00:00:28.077
That rascal.

00:00:28.397 --> 00:00:29.657
Listen, I don't know
if you're aware.

00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:32.458
Rachel does not care
for you at all.

00:00:33.157 --> 00:00:34.157
Oh, I'm aware. Yeah.

00:00:34.877 --> 00:00:36.857
Seriously, bro,
you got work to do.

00:00:37.417 --> 00:00:38.417
Hey!
Hey.

00:00:38.677 --> 00:00:40.897
Good to see you!
Thanks for coming, Tom.

00:00:40.897 --> 00:00:43.597
Really glad you came.
Really?

00:00:43.637 --> 00:00:44.637
Uh...

00:00:44.818 --> 00:00:46.538
Great to see you, too.
Congratulations.

00:00:47.058 --> 00:00:49.397
I mean, you guys seem
really happy together.

00:00:49.797 --> 00:00:51.297
You know,
you're all right,
Thomas Wachowski.

00:00:51.637 --> 00:00:52.637
Ah.

00:00:53.057 --> 00:00:54.277
Can we bury the hatchet?

00:00:54.838 --> 00:00:55.838
I'd love that.

00:00:55.838 --> 00:00:56.522
Yeah?
Yeah.

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:58.945
All right, bring it in!
All right!
Great.

00:00:59.054 --> 00:01:02.925
Oh. And if you
screw up my wedding,
I will end you.

00:01:03.911 --> 00:01:06.757
[people chattering on TV]

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:10.168
All right, Ozzy,
it's movie night
at Casa de Sonic,

00:01:10.328 --> 00:01:11.348
and it's your turn
to pick.

00:01:11.588 --> 00:01:13.768
But I am not watching
Snow Dogsagain.

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:15.808
That movie is
the worst!

00:01:15.945 --> 00:01:18.231
[electricity powering down]

00:01:18.368 --> 00:01:20.568
[laughs] Blackout!

00:01:22.368 --> 00:01:23.828
[spooky wailing] Ozzy!
[Ozzy whines]

00:01:24.688 --> 00:01:26.868
Oh, sorry, buddy.
Everything's okay.

00:01:27.742 --> 00:01:29.127
Whoa!

00:01:29.237 --> 00:01:31.644
[static on TV]

00:01:33.468 --> 00:01:36.928
Uh, excuse me.
We did not order a poltergeist.

00:01:37.045 --> 00:01:40.034
[thunder rumbling]

00:01:40.811 --> 00:01:43.139
[electricity buzzing]

00:01:43.993 --> 00:01:46.749
[heavy footsteps thudding]

00:01:46.867 --> 00:01:50.468
Um, if this is the pizza guy,
this is really unprofessional.

00:02:09.497 --> 00:02:10.497
Eggman?

00:02:10.586 --> 00:02:11.859
[crackling]

00:02:13.577 --> 00:02:16.158
Hello, hedgehog.

00:02:17.438 --> 00:02:18.798
Did you miss me?

00:02:20.038 --> 00:02:21.898
I don't know
how you got back,

00:02:22.138 --> 00:02:24.737
but you made
a big mistake coming here.

00:02:24.832 --> 00:02:27.880
Au contraire, mon frère.

00:02:27.977 --> 00:02:30.058
The mistake
was thinking you'd won.

00:02:30.758 --> 00:02:33.178
But that was just a prelude,
an hors d'oeuvre,

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:35.648
an aperitif,
an amuse-bouche.

00:02:35.758 --> 00:02:36.758
I get it.

00:02:36.847 --> 00:02:38.028
[laughs]

00:02:38.118 --> 00:02:39.918
I don't think you do.

00:02:40.498 --> 00:02:41.498
But you're about to.

00:02:41.918 --> 00:02:44.218
And so will
that idiot sheriff
and his wife.

00:02:46.718 --> 00:02:48.638
And your little dog too!

00:02:49.704 --> 00:02:51.019
[yells]

00:02:55.709 --> 00:02:57.522
[Sonic grunts]

00:02:58.091 --> 00:02:59.477
[groans]

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:02.888
[groans]

00:03:08.218 --> 00:03:09.218
Pitiful.

00:03:09.218 --> 00:03:11.698
What? Who are you?

00:03:13.598 --> 00:03:15.518
Where are my manners?

00:03:17.238 --> 00:03:19.338
Sonic,
meet Knuckles.

00:03:19.878 --> 00:03:21.798
My new BFFAE.

00:03:22.398 --> 00:03:25.098
Bestest friend
forever and ever!

00:03:25.938 --> 00:03:28.737
Look, Robotnik, I don't care
who you brought to help you.

00:03:29.038 --> 00:03:30.878
You're never going
to get my power.

00:03:31.198 --> 00:03:33.518
Do I look like
I need your power?

00:03:33.622 --> 00:03:36.472
[both yelling]

00:03:36.577 --> 00:03:38.315
[grunts]

00:03:44.017 --> 00:03:48.077
So nice when diabolical evil
lives up to the hype.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:49.318
[groaning]

00:03:49.411 --> 00:03:51.304
[grunts]

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:52.837
Where is it?

00:03:53.178 --> 00:03:55.877
Oh, you want it?
Here it comes.

00:03:56.337 --> 00:03:58.277
I was expecting
more of you.

00:03:59.178 --> 00:04:00.658
You're unskilled.

00:04:02.158 --> 00:04:03.158
Untrained.

00:04:04.495 --> 00:04:07.032
And unworthy!

00:04:08.267 --> 00:04:11.068
You forgot one.
Unstoppable.

00:04:16.412 --> 00:04:18.643
[energy crackling]

00:04:26.855 --> 00:04:29.226
[yelling]

00:04:33.899 --> 00:04:35.421
[groaning]

00:04:37.368 --> 00:04:41.108
It is my destiny to do
what my ancestors could not--

00:04:41.108 --> 00:04:45.448
to restore the ultimate power
to the home of my people.

00:04:46.548 --> 00:04:47.728
[Sonic] Ultimate power?

00:04:47.908 --> 00:04:49.548
I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:04:50.088 --> 00:04:51.608
You've got
the wrong guy.

00:04:52.128 --> 00:04:53.168
Ultimate power?

00:04:54.088 --> 00:04:56.468
Now you're speaking
my language.

00:04:57.047 --> 00:04:59.908
Don't play dumb with me,
apprentice of Longclaw.

00:05:00.268 --> 00:05:01.268
You knew Longclaw?

00:05:02.288 --> 00:05:06.008
Longclaw and her people were
the sworn enemy of my tribe,
the Echidna.

00:05:06.008 --> 00:05:08.428
We fought and died
at their hands,

00:05:08.428 --> 00:05:11.128
and now you will die
at mine.

00:05:11.233 --> 00:05:13.596
[siren wailing]

00:05:16.523 --> 00:05:18.074
[grunts]

00:05:19.272 --> 00:05:21.811
[imitating
electric servo motors]

00:05:21.917 --> 00:05:23.937
Come on. Get in!
I'm on your side.

00:05:24.058 --> 00:05:25.258
I'm sorry. Who are you?

00:05:25.676 --> 00:05:26.745
[groaning]

00:05:26.857 --> 00:05:28.357
You know what?
It doesn't matter.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:29.700
[grunts]

00:05:29.835 --> 00:05:31.403
[both scream]

00:05:31.537 --> 00:05:32.537
[Sonic] Get us out of here!
Go, go, go!

00:05:32.671 --> 00:05:34.315
[tires squealing]

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.073
[grunting, snarling]

00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:38.848
Ah! He's gone rabid!

00:05:38.944 --> 00:05:40.889
[growling]
[whimpering]

00:05:40.987 --> 00:05:42.608
Gross!
Is he licking it?

00:05:43.608 --> 00:05:44.608
See ya!

00:05:44.787 --> 00:05:46.987
[Sonic] Make sure
to get your shots, Eggman!

00:05:47.799 --> 00:05:50.943
[panting]

00:05:52.644 --> 00:05:54.752
[Sonic] Whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa!

00:05:54.863 --> 00:05:56.491
Whoa!

00:05:58.228 --> 00:05:59.856
[yelling]

00:06:01.288 --> 00:06:02.888
Wow. Okay.
Let me just say

00:06:03.008 --> 00:06:04.668
it is an honor
to finally meet you,
Sonic.

00:06:04.868 --> 00:06:07.528
Is it okay
if I call you Sonic?
Everyone calls me Tails.

00:06:07.668 --> 00:06:08.888
You're probably
wondering why.

00:06:09.348 --> 00:06:12.468
Let me guess.
Because of the extra tail?
That's right!

00:06:12.708 --> 00:06:14.388
I should've known
you'd get that.
Cool.

00:06:14.668 --> 00:06:17.668
Also, what is going on?
Robotnik's back?

00:06:17.767 --> 00:06:20.168
And who is Clifford
the Big Red Rage Monster?

00:06:20.428 --> 00:06:22.828
[Tails] That's Knuckles,
the last of the Echidnas

00:06:22.928 --> 00:06:24.928
and the most dangerous warrior
in the galaxy.

00:06:25.448 --> 00:06:27.608
He's obsessed with finding
the Master Emerald.

00:06:27.747 --> 00:06:29.808
[Sonic] Are you serious?
The Master Emerald?

00:06:29.808 --> 00:06:31.588
That's just
a bedtime story.

00:06:31.767 --> 00:06:33.088
Well,
he believes it's real.

00:06:33.328 --> 00:06:35.408
And he must think
you're the key
to finding it.

00:06:37.517 --> 00:06:39.317
Red light!
Give me the wheel!

00:06:39.477 --> 00:06:41.477
Hey, what are you--
Move your foot.

00:06:42.365 --> 00:06:43.475
[horn honking]

00:06:43.587 --> 00:06:47.251
[Sonic yelling]

00:06:48.547 --> 00:06:50.107
[sighs]
I think we lost him.

